  </div>

  <div class="col-md-3">
    <div class="step-card">
      <strong>2</strong>
      <h4>Answer guided questions</h4>
      <p>Fill in simple details about your market, costs, products, and operations.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="col-md-3">
    <div class="step-card">
      <strong>3</strong>
      <h4>Generate your plan</h4>
      <p>MasterPlan prepares a professional plan using your own information.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="col-md-3">
    <div class="step-card">
      <strong>4</strong>
      <h4>Download and use it</h4>
      <p>Export your plan and use it for funding, partners, investors, or personal planning.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
